    "text": "By WEAR staff ,\n8 hours ago PENSACOLA, Fla. -- Pensacola Police are trying to locate a 37-year-old missing woman. Police say Robin Whitmire has not been seen since Friday in the area of Cypress Street and L Street. She is approximately 5’2” and 98 lbs. Whitmire was last seen wearing a matching brown jacket... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
